# Update Timestamp Before Commit

Before creating any commit in this repository, run:

```powershell
.\update_timestamp.ps1
```

Requirements:
- Run the script in the repository root (`flash_dutch`).
- Include the timestamp change in the same commit together with code changes.
- Verify `index.html` has updated `last-update-time` before committing.

If the script fails, stop and report the error instead of committing.
